Individual brand logos are trademarks of their respective owners and are used
here only to identify the corresponding software.

IP geolocation database
-----------------------
The agent container image bundles the DB-IP Lite Country database
(/usr/share/tugra/geoip/country.mmdb), downloaded at image build time and read
locally by the agent; it is never fetched at runtime.
  Source:  https://db-ip.com (IP Geolocation by DB-IP)
  Data:    Copyright (c) 2019-2026 DB-IP
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

World map data
--------------
apps/web/src/lib/geo/world-countries-110m.json is the Natural Earth 1:110m
country boundary dataset, public domain, via the world-atlas dataset. It is
bundled as a static file; the map never fetches geography at runtime.
